{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Mind","html":"<article id='sn1.62'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.62 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.62 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>7. Addhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>7. Overcome </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Cittasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Mind </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kenassu nīyati loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“What leads the world on? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kenassu parikassati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What drags it around? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kissassu ekadhammassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What is the one thing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbeva vasamanvagū”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that has everything under its sway?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Cittena nīyati loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“The mind leads the world on. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>cittena parikassati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The mind drags it around. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Cittassa ekadhammassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Mind is the one thing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbeva vasamanvagū”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that has everything under its sway.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
